<title>UK: Lehman appoints economist for Germany.</title>
<headline>Lehman appoints economist for Germany.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Tuesday it appointed Klaus Baader senior international economist responsible for Germany.</p>
<p>Baader was previously currency economist at Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and before that he was at Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>He will report to John Llewellyn, global chief economist at Lehman and will be based in London.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 6176</p>
</text>
